ooking flow with passenger forms, price breakdown, and confirmation\n- My Trips page with upcoming/past/cancelled tabs and booking management\n- Explore page with destination map, flexible dates grid, and deals section\n- Popular destinations and recent searches on home page\n- Tracked price routes functionality\n- Full backend with Netlify Functions and Neon Postgres database\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
