[2026-03-15T09:43:52.344Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011dUfEZpMoYZHPkmpzryetb","type":"tool_result","content":"# Replay Playwright Setup Instructions\n\n## 1. Import Statement\n```typescript\nimport { replayReporter, devices as replayDevices } from \"@replayio/playwright\";\n```\n\n## 2. Configure Projects for Replay Browser\nAdd this project configuration to your `playwright.config.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nprojects: [\n  {\n    name: \"replay-chromium\",\n    use: { ...replayDevices[\"Replay Chromium\"] },\n  },\n],\n```\n\n## 3. Configure Reporter\n```typescript\nreporter: [\n  replayReporter({\n    apiKey: process.env.REPLAY_API_KEY,\n    upload: true,\n  }),\n  [\"line\"],\n],\n```\n\n## Required Setup Steps\n\n**Environment Variable:**\n- Set `REPLAY_API_KEY` via `.env` file, export command, or system variable after obtaining it from https://app.replay.io/team/new/tests\n\n**Pre-requisites:**\n- `npm install --save-dev @replayio/playwright`\n- `npx replayio install`\n\n**Execution:**\nRun tests using: `npx playwright test --project replay-chromium`\n\nThe configuration automatically uploads recordings when tests complete due to `\"upload: true\"`."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8a9ec40f-eca3-4106-a3d3-0a22e546d865","uuid":"21e09a14-a0ee-43ba-b8c6-40210e3ad012","tool_use_result":{"bytes":5167,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Replay Playwright Setup Instructions\n\n## 1. Import Statement\n```typescript\nimport { replayReporter, devices as replayDevices } from \"@replayio/playwright\";\n```\n\n## 2. Configure Projects for Replay Browser\nAdd this project configuration to your `playwright.config.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nprojects: [\n  {\n    name: \"replay-chromium\",\n    use: { ...replayDevices[\"Replay Chromium\"] },\n  },\n],\n```\n\n## 3. Configure Reporter\n```typescript\nreporter: [\n  replayReporter({\n    apiKey: process.env.REPLAY_API_KEY,\n    upload: true,\n  }),\n  [\"line\"],\n],\n```\n\n## Required Setup Steps\n\n**Environment Variable:**\n- Set `REPLAY_API_KEY` via `.env` file, export command, or system variable after obtaining it from https://app.replay.io/team/new/tests\n\n**Pre-requisites:**\n- `npm install --save-dev @replayio/playwright`\n- `npx replayio install`\n\n**Execution:**\nRun tests using: `npx playwright test --project replay-chromium`\n\nThe configuration automatically uploads recordings when tests complete due to `\"upload: true\"`.","durationMs":3140,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/replayio/skills/refs/heads/main/skills/replay-playwright/SKILL.md"}}
